OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including soprano Sandra
OL,8,     GPiau live from Wigmore Hall and
OL,9,     GSaint-Saens's 3rd Violin Concerto
OL,10,     Gfrom Montpellier.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod delves into the
OL,13,     Gearly life of the great German
OL,14,     Gcomposer Heinrich Schutz, when
OL,15,     Gthe boy's musical talents were
OL,16,     Gdiscovered by an aristocrat.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GKatie Derham welcomes the
OL,19,     GSitkovetsky Trio in studio for a
OL,20,     Glive performance, and live music
OL,21,     Gfrom jazz singers Emma Smith and
OL,22,     GNatalie Williams.
